WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.190
I have to tell you about something interesting
that's happened in the last 48 hours.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:08.780
I received a bunch of emails and tweets from
people saying, you know, David, I wasn't planning

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.000
to vote for Biden because he's not a progressive.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.670
I don't believe in choosing the lesser of
two evils.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:20.850
But after Donald Trump's authoritarian nightmare
of a declaration on Monday night about deploying

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:28.850
the military to states, I realize I have to
vote for Joe Biden this these last 72 or so

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:31.140
hours from Donald Trump.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.819
For many of my viewers have become a breaking
point now.

00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:37.750
I don't want you to write to me.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.129
I don't need you to write to me and say, not
me, David.

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:42.559
I'm still never voting for Biden, okay?

00:00:42.559 --> 00:00:44.249
I'm not talking about you.

00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:49.829
What I'm telling you is that I have seen nothing
since the start of this election that has

00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:56.069
triggered so many emails from people saying
I was not on board with Biden for this reason

00:00:56.069 --> 00:00:57.559
or for that reason.

00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:02.980
But over the last three days, I've realized
I have to vote for Biden in November because

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.210
this has gone too far.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.439
Check out some of the tweets that were sent
to me.

00:01:07.439 --> 00:01:08.439
Here's one quote.

00:01:08.439 --> 00:01:13.670
I despise Biden and the Democrats still do,
but at least he won't try to label millions

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.570
of our citizens as terrorists and sic the
military on us.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:24.659
I will crawl over broken glass to vote for
him in the fall.

00:01:24.659 --> 00:01:29.700
Another tweet quote, I've been a Bernie supporter
before people knew he existed.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:35.360
Yet I am Vote Blue to save America 2020 as
a history professor.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.100
I've seen this before.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:43.630
When you have a chance to halt fascism, you
do it, then fight for a leftist push.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:49.329
Question what will we do when Trump refuses
to leave the White House?

00:01:49.329 --> 00:01:52.390
Another tweet saying, quote, Same here.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:55.380
That press conference B.S. was the nail in
the coffin.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.490
So, listen, this is logical.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:02.579
We are now seeing this nascent authoritarianism
come full circle.

00:02:02.579 --> 00:02:07.069
And I want to add something that somebody
tweeted to me that I believe is very important

00:02:07.069 --> 00:02:08.909
in the context of this conversation.

00:02:08.909 --> 00:02:13.590
I got a tweet which said, quote, They need
to be encouraged and not shamed.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.790
And that is exactly right.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:21.740
We were never going to shame people out of
sitting aside in November.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.820
It wasn't going to work.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:29.470
I've been talking about the futility of voter
shaming for several weeks, if not months now.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:31.330
And I'm not going to shame them now.

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.849
I have no interest in doing this.

00:02:32.849 --> 00:02:38.569
I told you so stuff with the never Biden folks
who are realizing this is a crisis and we've

00:02:38.569 --> 00:02:40.060
got to remove Trump.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.540
What I'm going to say is I'm thrilled.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.540
I'm thrilled.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.430
And I knew you would come around.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:49.060
You are seeing the reality of the situation
for what it is.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.650
Let's get together and defeat Donald Trump.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.210
I'm glad to have you.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.560
No shame here.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:56.850
No, I told you so here.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:57.850
None of this stuff.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:59.860
I encourage everybody to do the exact same
thing.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.760
I know that you know the YouTube comments.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.900
People will say, David, you're so stupid.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:05.900
I'm stunned.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:06.900
Always.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:07.900
Never.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:08.900
Biden.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:09.900
I'm not talking about you.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.190
And we don't need everyone.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:15.980
We just need some people to realize staying
home is not OK.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.980
Right.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:20.680
Right now, this week, we need to remove Donald
Trump.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:26.420
If the last 72 hours haven't made that sickeningly
clear, then I don't know that there's anything

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.709
left that would convince you.

00:03:27.709 --> 00:03:33.069
And in fact, I think, again, without shame,
with total peace and love and curiosity, I

00:03:33.069 --> 00:03:37.670
would go back to the folks that are still
never Biden and say, I want to engage with

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:44.069
you now that Donald Trump has continued this
hatred authoritarian slide.

00:03:44.069 --> 00:03:47.000
What else do you need to say?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.140
I've got to do it.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.810
I've got to vote for Biden.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.219
Is it some specific policy position?

00:03:53.219 --> 00:03:59.519
Is there anything Trump could do that would
get you to say, OK, now he's clearly bad enough

00:03:59.519 --> 00:04:03.370
that I'm going to vote for Biden rather than
staying home or voting third party or whatever?

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:04.940
I want to hear from you and I hope that you
will let me know.

